  {
    "id": "u5b",
    "unit": 5,
    "part": "b",
    "title": "Food we eat",
    "page": 55,
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "Mrs Green",
        "gender": "female",
        "text": "What's your favourite fruit, Binbin?",
        "audio": "text-22ecefdda2400bfe",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-01-1e000d13d320.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "Coconuts are my favourite.",
        "audio": "text-883a5682eab7ec40",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-01-1e000d13d320.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mrs Green",
        "gender": "female",
        "text": "Why do you like coconuts?",
        "audio": "text-6596c2029e9d19f3",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-01-1e000d13d320.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "Because coconut water is nice.",
        "audio": "text-a79c9325d31d6aef",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-02-b80d9cbdaa75.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "And it's healthy.",
        "audio": "text-160e7c9de57aaf04",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-02-b80d9cbdaa75.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mrs Green",
        "gender": "female",
        "text": "We can also cook delicious meals with coconut.",
        "audio": "text-b0b0090fba4a5375",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-02-b80d9cbdaa75.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "Yes!",
        "audio": "text-4fd6ea6dd7da11be",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-03-0b732cad8c1b.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "And some people make houses with coconut tree leaves.",
        "audio": "text-0d95969ed0a47769",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-03-0b732cad8c1b.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mrs Green",
        "gender": "female",
        "text": "That's interesting.",
        "audio": "text-4d5b39b57cc5b4f4",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-03-0b732cad8c1b.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mrs Green",
        "gender": "female",
        "text": "Where does your coconut come from?",
        "audio": "text-7c25341d0ae7fff7",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-04-8ac4fa9a3e11.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "Hainan!",
        "audio": "text-49a73097e731bbed",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-04-8ac4fa9a3e11.json"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Binbin",
        "gender": "male",
        "text": "There are many coconut trees there.",
        "audio": "text-e57d36453d0b8c93",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "audioPack": "text-u5b-04-8ac4fa9a3e11.json"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "u6a",
    "unit": 6,
    "part": "a",
    "title": "Nature and us",
    "page": 64,
    "lines": [
      {
